[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to maximize the real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(|z| = 4\). Let's denote \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\). Then, we can substitute \(z\) into the expression and find the real part.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m First, let's rewrite the expression in terms of \(\theta\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + 4i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)}{4(\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m = \frac{96 \cos \theta - 96i \sin \theta + 144i \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta}{4} = \frac{96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta + i(144 \cos \theta - 96 \sin \theta)}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m = 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta + i(36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m Now, combining both parts, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + 4i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta) + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta + i(36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta)
