[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m The real part of this expression is \(324 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta\). To maximize this, we need to maximize \(324 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta\). The maximum value of \(a \cos \theta - b \sin \theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\), so the maximum value of \(324 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta\) is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 468^2}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \sqrt{324^2 + 468^2} = \sqrt{(324 \cdot 3)^2 + (468 \cdot 2)^2} = \sqrt{972^2 + 936^2} = \sqrt{(972^2 + 936^2)} = \sqrt{(36 \cdot 27)^2 + (36 \cdot 26)^2} = 36 \sqrt{27^2 + 26^2} = 36 \sqrt{729 + 676} = 36 \sqrt{1405}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=145523)[0m \]
